---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/people.css';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../../static/images/team/dean-editorial-v1.png';
import { dean, explorations } from '../data/people';
const links = [{href:'#people',label:'认识个体'},{href:'#work',label:'看见创造'},{href:'#together',label:'一起做事'}];
const title='AIRDB Team — 各有锋芒，彼此成光';
const description='看见每个独立创造者的独特风貌，在共同创造中成就彼此。各美其美，美人之美，美美与共。';
const structuredData={ '@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Organization',name:'AIRDB Team',url:'https://airdb.team/',email:'info@airdb.com',founder:{'@type':'Person',name:'阿正_Dean',alternateName:'Dean'}};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href="https://airdb.team/"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content="https://airdb.team/"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://airdb.team/images/team/dean-editorial-v1.png"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Dean 的 AI 艺术肖像，蓝色背景与珊瑚色连接线"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/>
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json"/>
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-400-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin/>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)}/>
</head>
<body class="people-site">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="people-header"><a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="AIRDB Team 首页"><strong>AIRDB</strong><span>/</span><em>TEAM</em></a><nav class="people-desktop-nav" aria-label="主导航">{links.map(l=><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}<a class="nav-invite" href="#contact">来，认识一下 ↗</a></nav><details class="people-mobile-nav"><summary>菜单 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><nav aria-label="手机导航">{links.map(l=><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}<a href="#contact">来，认识一下 ↗</a></nav></details></header>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
<section class="people-hero" id="top"><div class="people-hero-copy" id="network"><div class="editorial-index"><span>AIRDB / PEOPLE</span><span>独立而相连</span></div><h1>各有锋芒，<br/><em>彼此成光。</em></h1><p class="hero-statement">一个人，有自己的世界。<br/>一群人，让世界多一些可能。</p><p class="hero-explanation">我们珍视每个创造者独特的判断、热爱与手艺。保持自己的样子，也在共同创造中成就彼此。</p><a class="people-primary" href="#people">先认识一个人 <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><div class="hero-signoff"><span>INDIVIDUALITY × COLLECTIVE CREATIVITY</span><span>从真实的人开始，慢慢长成一片森林。</span></div></div><figure class="hero-portrait"><Image src={portrait} widths={[480,800,1122]} sizes="(max-width: 520px) 100vw, 50vw" format="webp" loading="eager" alt="Dean 的 AI 艺术形象：戴眼镜的独立构建者，手持电脑，身后是蓝色几何色块与珊瑚色连线" width="1122" height="1402" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><div><strong>DEAN</strong><span>构建者 / 连接者</span></div><p>{dean.portraitNote}</p></figcaption></figure></section>
<div class="people-mantra" aria-label="共同的主张"><span>各美其美</span><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span>美人之美</span><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span>美美与共</span><small>DIFFERENT MINDS. SHARED POSSIBILITY.</small></div>
<section class="person-section" id="people"><div class="section-kicker"><span>01 / 各美其美</span><span>THE INDIVIDUAL</span></div><div class="person-heading"><h2>先看见一个人，<br/>再看见他的世界。</h2><p>头衔是一个起点。真正让人记住的，是他在意什么、相信什么，以及愿意花时间把什么做好。</p></div><article class="person-profile" id="dean"><div class="profile-identity"><span class="profile-handle">{dean.handle}</span><h3>{dean.name}</h3><p>{dean.role}</p><blockquote>“{dean.quote}”</blockquote><div class="profile-tags">{dean.tags.map(t=><span>{t}</span>)}</div><a class="profile-contact" href="mailto:info@airdb.com?subject=Hello%20Dean%20%E2%80%94%20AIRDB%20Team">和 Dean 聊聊 ↗</a></div><div class="profile-story"><p class="profile-lead">{dean.description}</p><div class="profile-principles">{dean.principles.map((p,i)=><div><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h4>{p.title}</h4><p>{p.text}</p></div></div>)}</div><p class="profile-note">这是一份持续生长的人物档案。用接下来的作品与实践，把它写得更具体。</p></div></article></section>
<section class="appreciation-section" id="capabilities"><div class="section-kicker"><span>02 / 美人之美</span><span>ROOM FOR DIFFERENCE</span></div><div class="appreciation-layout"><h2>优秀不必相同，<br/>欣赏让彼此靠近。</h2><div><p class="big-copy">有人把问题看得更深，<br/>有人把想法做得更真，<br/>有人让不同的人开始对话。</p><p>我们期待这样的同伴：对自己的领域有热情，也对别人的专业有敬意。带着独立判断来，不必把自己变成另一个人的样子。</p><a class="people-text-link" href="#contact">说说你正在认真做的事 ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="work-section" id="work"><div class="section-kicker"><span>03 / 看见创造</span><span>IDEAS INTO PRACTICE</span></div><div class="person-heading"><h2>让热爱，有迹可循。</h2><p>从这些正在关注的方向，走近构建者的世界。这里是探索入口，具体进展以各项目站点为准。</p></div><div class="exploration-list">{explorations.map(w=><a href={w.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="work-number">{w.id}</span><div><span class="work-subtitle">{w.subtitle}</span><h3>{w.title}</h3></div><p>{w.text}</p><span class="work-link">{w.label} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="together-section" id="about"><div id="together" class="section-kicker"><span>04 / 美美与共</span><span>BETTER, TOGETHER</span></div><div class="together-heading"><h2>不是磨平棱角，<br/>是让不同，<em>一起发生。</em></h2><p>个体的优秀，是共同创造的起点。我们希望围绕一个真实问题，让不同的视角相遇，让各自的长处有机会彼此成就。</p></div><ol class="together-steps"><li><span>01 / 相识</span><h3>先认识彼此。</h3><p>带来一个作品、一个问题，或一段你愿意认真讲述的经历。</p></li><li><span>02 / 共创</span><h3>从一件小事开始。</h3><p>找到共同关心的问题，明确各自的贡献与边界，再一起动手。</p></li><li><span>03 / 共生</span><h3>让连接持续生长。</h3><p>分享过程与收获，尊重每个人的署名、选择与独立方向。</p></li></ol><p class="together-note">这是我们期待实践的协作方式。未来的合作故事，由真正参与的人一起书写。</p></section>
<section class="people-invite" id="contact"><p class="section-kicker">NEXT / THE NEXT PERSON COULD BE YOU</p><h2>带着你的世界来。</h2><p>你在钻研什么？做出了什么？又想和什么样的人一起，完成下一件值得做的事？</p><a class="people-primary" href="mailto:info@airdb.com?subject=%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%88%9B%E9%80%A0%E8%80%85%20%E2%80%94%20AIRDB%20Team">来，认识一下 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="invite-email" href="mailto:info@airdb.com">info@airdb.com</a></section>
</main>
<footer class="people-footer"><div><a class="brand" href="#top"><strong>AIRDB</strong><span>/</span><em>TEAM</em></a><p>各自精彩，共同生长。</p></div><nav aria-label="页脚导航"><a href="https://airdb.com/">AirDB 主站 ↗</a><a href="https://airdb.group/">AirDB Group ↗</a><a href="#contact">认识我们</a></nav><div class="people-footer-bottom"><small>© {new Date().getUTCFullYear()} AIRDB Team</small><span>人物形象为 AI 艺术创作；人物与项目介绍独立维护。</span><a href="#top">回到顶部 ↑</a></div></footer>
<script>
 document.querySelectorAll('.people-mobile-nav a').forEach(link=>link.addEventListener('click',()=>document.querySelector('.people-mobile-nav')?.removeAttribute('open')));
</script>
</body>
</html>
